Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:03.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,I started contacting\Ncustomers before my tools
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.33,0:00:04.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,were ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:05.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,Not because I was\Nconfident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:08.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,Because every week I\Nwaited, I learned nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:11.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,So I picked a small\Ngroup of real people and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,sent the first message.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:19.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then I built the tool to\Nkeep track of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:20.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,A to-do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,A follow-up date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:23.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,A place to write down\Nwhat happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:25.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,You don't need the\Nperfect plan to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:27.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,You need the next small\Nstep,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:30.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,and somewhere to record\Nwhat happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:30.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm Andrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:33.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm building a business,\Nand the software to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:34.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:35.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,Follow along.
